The aim of this project is to develop an AI-powered campus assistant that helps students, parents, faculty, and visitors quickly get information about Malla Reddy Deemed University (MRDU). The assistant provides information about courses, admissions, placements, campus facilities, hostels, and other university-related queries.

Overview

The MRDU Campus AI Agent is a web-based chatbot designed as a digital campus concierge. Users can type their questions in the chat interface and receive AI-generated answers.

The system provides quick-access options for common queries such as MRDU programs, admission details, placement information, campus facilities, and contact details. It also supports live web search grounding to provide updated information when enabled.

The application includes voice input using speech recognition and can also provide voice responses using text-to-speech. Users can clear the conversation and copy AI-generated responses when required.

Technologies Used
HTML5 – Used to create the structure of the web application.
CSS3 – Used for styling and designing the user interface.
JavaScript – Used to implement chatbot functionality, user interaction, API communication, and voice features.
Tailwind CSS – Used to create a responsive and modern user interface.
Google Gemini API – Used to generate AI-based responses.
Google Search Grounding – Used to retrieve real-time web information when enabled.
Web Speech API – Used for voice input through speech recognition.
Gemini Text-to-Speech (TTS) – Used to generate spoken responses.
Font Awesome – Used for icons in the interface.
Marked.js – Used to display AI responses with Markdown formatting.